Catz 5 — macOS recompilation port
NOTICE

This repository contains only recompilation tooling, configuration and native
host code. It contains no game executables, data, artwork, audio, levels or
other assets. A translated build is produced locally from the user's own copy
of Catz 5 and is not distributed here.

